# AI language (Deutsch / English)

## Global rule

Every **user-facing AI** area must expose the same language switch and read from one source:

| Piece | Location |
|-------|----------|
| Context | `src/context/AiLanguageContext.jsx` — `useAiLanguage()` |
| Storage | `src/lib/ai/languageStorage.js` — `localStorage` key `scanlogic_ai_language` |
| UI tabs | `src/components/shared/AiLanguageTabs.jsx` |
| Footer bar | `src/components/shared/AiLanguageBar.jsx` — **above every AI chat input** |
| Prompt helper | `src/lib/ai/promptLanguage.js` — `aiLanguageInstruction(language)` |

Provider wraps the app in `main.jsx` (`AiLanguageProvider`).

## UI placement (required)

1. **`AiLanguageBar`** directly above the message/input form (always visible while chatting).
2. **Compact `AiLanguageTabs`** in the panel header when there is a chat header.
3. For long structured AI output (e.g. Executive Summary), optional inline tabs in the response card.

Do **not** hide language behind a single tiny “EN/DE” chip.

## LLM calls

Pass `language` from `useAiLanguage()` into prompts:

```javascript
import { aiLanguageInstruction } from '@/lib/ai/promptLanguage'

const prompt = `${aiLanguageInstruction(language)}\n\n...`
```

Never auto-detect language from user text when the UI language toggle is set.

## Covered areas

- Lawyer AI (`LawyerAIPage.jsx`)
- App Guide drawer (`AppGuideDrawer.jsx`)
- BizStart registration chat (`RegistrationChat.jsx`)
- Docs scan OCR/classification (`scanPipeline.js`)
- Tax Vault receipt OCR (`ReceiptManager.jsx`, `ReceiptScanFlow.jsx`)
- Settings (`SettingsPage.jsx`) — global default for all AI modules

When adding a new AI feature, wire `useAiLanguage` + `AiLanguageBar` + `aiLanguageInstruction`.
